OL,3,GNEWSAPolice release CCTV in search for
OL,4,Amissing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have released CCTV footage of a
OL,7,FBurnley woman who has been missing
OL,8,Fsince last week.
OL,10,FThe last confirmed sighting of Julie
OL,11,FFoster, 63, was heading towards
OL,12,FShakespeare Street in Padiham on
OL,13,FThursday 8 October, at about 13:45 BST,
OL,14,FLancashire Police said.
OL,16,FThe force said it was very concerned
OL,17,Fabout her welfare.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
