OL,3,GNEWSAPolice release CCTV in search for
OL,4,Amissing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have described Foster as 5 ft 2
OL,7,Fin (1.57m) tall, with shoulder-length
OL,8,Fred hair, a pale complexion, and a
OL,9,Fmedium build. The footage shows her
OL,10,Fwearing a distinctive yellow jacket
OL,11,Fwith a black top and leggings, and
OL,12,Fwhite trainers. She was carrying a
OL,13,Fhandbag and another blue tote bag over
OL,14,Fher shoulder.
